@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Booking — Book a Workshop and Confirm Deposit
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest or Member|
:Select location;
:Select date, one daily session and package;
|System|
:Confirm that capacity is configured per location/session;
if (Selected session has capacity?) then (yes)
  :Present booking summary;
else (no)
  :Reject selection and request another session;
  stop
endif
|Guest or Member|
:Enter required contact details\nor verify Member profile details;
if (Use ring-design flow?) then (yes)
  :Complete UC-Ring Design;
  |System|
  if (Design request is rejected?) then (yes)
    :Request another design choice;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
else (no)
endif
:Submit booking;
|System|
:Create Booking and Invoice;
:Set required deposit to 50% of package price;
:Set booking status to payment pending;
|Guest or Member|
:Start deposit payment;
|Payment Gateway|
:Return payment status through the approved confirmation mechanism;
|System|
if (Confirmation is valid and not a duplicate?) then (yes)
  :Record deposit PaymentTransaction;
  :Set Invoice deposit paid;
  :Set Booking confirmed;
  :Generate booking code and QR;
  |Email Sender|
  :Send confirmation notification;
  |System|
  if (Member?) then (yes)
    :Show/save Booking, Invoice and Transaction in history;
  else (no)
    :Offer optional Member registration;
  endif
else (pending, failed or invalid)
  :Keep Booking unconfirmed;
  :Show payment-pending or unconfirmed status;
endif

note right
Provider, webhook/IPN verification, reconciliation, retry, duplicate-event handling and refund handling are Open.
Browser redirect must not confirm payment.
end note
stop
@enduml
